00:01:16,210 --> 00:01:18,030
and we get indeed,

33
00:01:18,030 --> 00:01:20,486
or full array from one to eight.

34
00:01:20,486 --> 00:01:23,620
So (indistinct) removed the nested arrays

35
00:01:23,620 --> 00:01:25,310
and flattened the array,

